msgstr "接口地址"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:281
msgid "Leave empty to use the default address of the selected service. HTTPS only. For relays, enter the address that ends before /chat/completions (often ending in /v1)."
msgstr "留空则使用所选服务的默认地址。只接受 HTTPS。中转站请填到 /chat/completions 之前的部分（通常以 /v1 结尾）。"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:283
msgid "API key"
msgstr "API 密钥"

#: includes/wp/class-aitp-admin.php:285
